            "w": [
              {
                "t": "phr",
                "h": "refer to",
                "m": "phr.指的是",
                "sp": [
                  [
                    3,
                    12
                  ]
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "en": "They are called “paralinguistic features of language”.",
            "zh": "它们被称为“语言的副语言特征”。",
            "w": [
              {
                "t": "word",
                "h": "paralinguistic",
